{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109385","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109385/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109385/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109385/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109385","id":3299468432,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7EqeSQ","number":109385,"title":"Window size and position reset if moved during boot splash","user":{"login":"domdfcoding","id":8050853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA4NTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8050853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding","html_url":"https://github.com/domdfcoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-07T08:06:43Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T10:48:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nOccurs in v4.3, v4.4.1 and v4.5-beta4, and I remember it happening in v4.2.2 as well.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable (2a0a14459) - Ubuntu 20.04.6 LTS (Focal Fossa) - X11 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - Radeon RX 580 Series (POLARIS10, DRM 3.42.0, 5.15.0-151-generic, LLVM 12.0.0) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor (16 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a window is moved during the boot splash screen it resets its position and size after the boot splash has finished. With multiple monitors it might take up position on whichever monitor the window is on at that point, not the one it started on.\n\nIt seems more likely to happen if the window size matches the monitor's, such that the window has to be maximised.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nClone and run https://github.com/domdfcoding/godot-bootsplashtest\n\nWhile the boot splash is shown, grab the window, move it on screen, and resize it. Once the splash times out after 5 seconds, the window should've gone back to being maximised. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/domdfcoding/godot-bootsplashtest","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109385/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}